able quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade state monitors are used; many neighborhoods have none."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0069_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87507,"sha256":"32c6191a68a6eb169dd6e26d6775c5854ffb61f4502a4db47a3543dc085967c3","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:43+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0307_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88633,"sha256":"fdb894876a95d29142128960f5003a95868a7261c800a37aeb0d09e5c74aa2fb","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:05+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0057_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0057","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88143,"sha256":"936337ee67a1b4235ab26abc1914890274dc0f26a86a55b6baf9249c31968fbd","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:28+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_1614_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_1614","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88562,"sha256":"8407b2e49bd79ad2b70a6de059bb16c199c3c165b3c0c93efd344fae4d6